# Which hackathon the indexer follows when the whole backend is started with
# `npm run dev`. It takes one contract at a time, so this is how somebody
# switches between events without editing a command.
#
# Only `npm run dev` reads it. Running the indexer directly still takes the
# address as an argument.
# Narrows the indexer to one hackathon. Left empty it follows every hackathon
# in the database, which is what you want unless you are debugging one event.
WATCH_CONTRACT=""
